{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n\n<p>發佈時間：20:10 2026-11-22 HKT</p>\n<img alt=\"金馬獎2026｜AK江𤒹生力壓田啟文奪最佳男配角  台上哽咽多謝父母粉絲  現場掌聲雷動人氣勁\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/cbfc2c8e59f2fdd42d598a6123d0f81c/2026-11/001_0_12.jpg\"/>\n<p>【金馬獎2026／第63屆金馬獎／金馬63】台灣電影界年度盛事「第63屆金馬獎」於今晚（22日）假台北流行音樂中心舉行，香港的MIRROR成員AK江𤒹生，憑《我們不是什麼》的優異表現，擊敗賽前被視為奪獎大熱「田雞」田啟文，首次提名就獲得最佳男配角獎。</p>\n<p>AK江𤒹生於台上表示，其父母也在現場，他大聲地表示「我得獎了」，之後他更多謝一直支持他的粉絲，指他們可以驕傲地表示，「你們從沒有人看上我的時候，你們已經看上我」，另外他亦多謝自己，表示自己曾經到韓國訓練，但卻未能出道，他就回香港當舞蹈員，「我是從台上最後的地方，一步步行上前面」，所以他都要多謝自己，之後他振臂高舉獎項，大有吐氣揚眉之感。</p>\n<p>AK江𤒹生於《我們不是什麼》中演男同性戀者，因為受到社會壓迫，之後和男伴一齊於巴士引爆炸彈，演出備受好評。今次AK江𤒹生文除了擊敗田啟文外，還壓倒還壓倒朱軒洋、黃冠智和林偉文得獎。田雞賽前得獎呼聲已經極高，但最後卻爆冷不敵AK江𤒹生。</p>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/d6ac8cd349c7b3c91c2530f95511817a/2026-11/VS--YouTube-63The63rdGoldenHorseAwardsCeremony-YouTube-82_22_.jpg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/d97c5e6ead03d981c26e37336689fd38/2026-11/VS--YouTube-63The63rdGoldenHorseAwardsCeremony-YouTube-82_24_.jpg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/cd7ead8d5d5cfcb9f714d2b9ab2df18f/2026-11/VS--YouTube-63The63rdGoldenHorseAwardsCeremony-YouTube-82_46_.jpg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/a5841578c77d274547ba2b86a06fa7ca/2026-11/VS--YouTube-63The63rdGoldenHorseAwardsCeremony-YouTube-83_15_.jpg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/158389c31f295aef89b6b98dfd69921e/2026-11/VS--YouTube-63The63rdGoldenHorseAwardsCeremony-YouTube-83_24_.jpg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/4d305d48c634eb6db9bb0fc12c5010b1/2026-11/VS--YouTube-63The63rdGoldenHorseAwardsCeremony-YouTube-83_26__0.jpg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/4ba52b934068d1f84191ebf07138a55a/2026-11/VS--YouTube-63The63rdGoldenHorseAwardsCeremony-YouTube-83_50__0.jpg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/7d87edb7669f78dd54474b542d5f6204/2026-11/VS--YouTube-63The63rdGoldenHorseAwardsCeremony-YouTube-83_56__0.jpg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/02599a59f13d6779c24a9adb26054b4c/2026-11/VS--YouTube-63The63rdGoldenHorseAwardsCeremony-YouTube-84_00_.jpg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/a8fc4021008da56dda857798665c7d48/2026-11/VS--YouTube-63The63rdGoldenHorseAwardsCeremony-YouTube-84_04_.jpg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/37e3ae41c7b6083b812a1a6711990129/2026-11/VS--YouTube-63The63rdGoldenHorseAwardsCeremony-YouTube-84_05_.jpg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/f0dfac04a2fd0c594f5b7179b11fcefb/2026-11/VS--YouTube-63The63rdGoldenHorseAwardsCeremony-YouTube-84_14__0.jpg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/ce90b56416bc9252ae129e22ede213f1/2026-11/VS--YouTube-63The63rdGoldenHorseAwardsCeremony-YouTube-84_27__0.jpg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/de6d54448814bd8a66cdc8cf2e801bcc/2026-11/VS--YouTube-63The63rdGoldenHorseAwardsCeremony-YouTube-84_50__0.jpg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/9ed7bf17b762fc99290315f377a22c8f/2026-11/VS--YouTube-63The63rdGoldenHorseAwardsCeremony-YouTube-85_16_.jpg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/6ab463e6c2d98e7bac5f88f98c0f6dc4/2026-11/VS--YouTube-63The63rdGoldenHorseAwardsCeremony-YouTube-85_20__0.jpg\"/>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-22T12:24:16.260105+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":439,"images":17,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-22T12:10:38+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-22T12:17:35.211085+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-22T12:17:35.211085+00:00","content_hash":"f84463476c05a13d2bd632f8ed71b314592e5dfb8256971dad746e7b13de17b6","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}